msgstr "一台运行 *Mission Planner* 的笔记本电脑。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:33
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:35 577797f2c90f4cfdb63f639e265343d8
#: 6f226de5cec344d39bbbd21bdea395fb 87d3457f92c742ee83594d4fa4cde4d8
#: 9191471915ef4198a6f7f7242cdd1ace f0cbc8dfc4db4513bf6d1dd46cc2a546
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:37 9cd89058db9a4368a91127505f43250d
#: dbfe643b7b2c409bbc2ea21ef4e1e1a3 dc41dcf6a7bd48d1b789480f643d1876
#: f6430bd1607d4688a1d8fbf80611b400 fa451861925341f2ad05360ced74ee5a
msgid ""
"First you must calibrate the joystick using the Windows joystick/game "
"controller wizard."
msgstr "首先需使用 Windows 操纵杆/游戏控制器向导校准操纵杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:40
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:42 29ea7d063b6d43cbb11569a01fbe070e
#: 45b9438b4fbf4227a8f5d1c6ed1f1271 91afc1d21a804778a78985f9f0ca7704
#: b2f3dea57a28438db15298cb4d96a323 bbb1088322534db8ad0861ba1968d21c
msgid "Setup with the Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:44 0f6f5b41ab0a409491b4753875e4f41c
msgid "Connect your USB joystick/gamepad to the laptop computer"
msgstr "将 USB 操纵杆/游戏手柄连接到笔记本电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:43
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:45 50681b6765514b92984d963777c105ea
#: 6345af4acd8a4a5ba93b0da54a56901b 668eaffadfa24076aef7c16dbccef5dd
#: 8f6b627faab74bd18f50af59ec0da564 c92101d918ff40ed97b1b91c422f6d38
msgid ""
"Open the *Mission Planner Flight Data* screen. On the **Actions** tab push "
"the **Joystick** button"
msgstr "打开 *Mission Planner 飞行数据* 界面，在 **Actions** 选项卡中点击 **Joystick** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:51 7ce97e28d7394985b90b08cca6edaabf
msgid "Ensure the Logitech joystick appears in the drop-down"
msgstr "确认 Logitech 操纵杆出现在下拉菜单中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:50
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:52 5a2b392675804529bc85ee47405030f1
#: a5b9f177f75d48b894f456ab9b7bf68b c73a171f9778416ba3e4eee88578decc
#: e25e3d8fa7ee4955b8417b08fc963c24 e9f2fe747da8437684bffce6d467544c
msgid ""
"The **Enable** button, once pushed, will tell the mission planner to start "
"sending commands to the vehicle so for the initial setup do not push it."
msgstr "**Enable** 按钮一旦按下，将告知 Mission Planner 开始向飞行器发送指令，因此初始配置阶段请勿按下该按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:53
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:55 08ccab6005c742c28c01512807f46c3c
#: 12abf3dde9444135b3bf94b4b26a702d 2aa70fb8bdc94d67936258cb9b4b3ec7
#: 55c4e5c646d84c61a7f760f4ab517ce8 df968907a69f4e6f8ffaf5bee32c64b9
msgid ""
"On the \"Roll\" row, click the **Auto Detect** button and then waggle the "
"control you wish to use for roll, left and right."
msgstr "在「Roll」行，点击 **Auto Detect** 按钮，然后左右拨动您希望用于横滚的控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:55
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:57 20687e2126b74787873ca629cad86c6a
#: 88c42038ec3547d284a105c4448b30c2 a3baad108866474e84dcf44fcf224c79
#: b0e5d84957054501afe14551771bb3b6 b3e13cb03a2e4b0782d3d3c46090cf02
msgid "The channel can be reversed with the *Reverse* checkbox"
msgstr "可通过 *Reverse* 复选框反转通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:58 5aa8775b65ee4b05b122b7323962b549
#: 7d3be52030ab4a0ba09b68e3770976eb c54671560a214ed5b179a6d2b28d7de0
#: dc40866d40fe4c8c9bf914a94b0fc8f7 f2f503b5a78b45d08680a437930e321c
msgid "The Expo number should be in the range of -100 to 100"
msgstr "Expo 数值应在 -100 到 100 之间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:60 8557ca68f6a54db0ac78d30070bf3999
#: 93e9f65d73ac439590b5e104ab05aace 99f6d0f8c7794ed38f5728cb32a04b02
#: bd2543419fab4743b044f37126750287 e5a354f6031e4cea92c9dc27d08597bc
msgid "0 = no expo"
msgstr "0 = 无指数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:61 1c3a3d8f52d346e3bc7c0556a1b6688c
#: 99f4e16d14a74935b80c87819f042afd aa9c18377dd14e14983440f955b5af86
#: e6f28594d6954336822f52b2392e684f f9666eddb726465fa07a0a0a0006f5df
msgid "100 = low response around the middle, very fast response at the edges"
msgstr "100 = 中间响应迟钝，边缘响应极快"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:61
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:63 4a515ffe307f4c74b3f6467a5e3b74d8
#: 9d14e60f24764fe5a386087789825194 a46b35dfbea549588842834921aaea93
#: fae5124c991f44d2a5c3d293426c0917 fd377b0aa94e4e48b43f944d70ee63d7
msgid ""
"-100 = very fast response around the middle, less response at the edges "
"(very few people use negative expo)"
msgstr "-100 = 中间响应极快，边缘响应较弱（很少有人使用负指数）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:66 10cf78bf35184faeadf72b994728068b
#: 51b8828e1c1f4b6b95abc6595f7a3d65 a7e2f33731c145c38004073eb4958cb6
#: e67a0f541b8943aa93965d98e169d869 e6fa395bf2c54ef8a4bc92090703940b
msgid ""
"Repeat for *Pitch*, *Throttle* and *Rudder* and push the **Save** button"
msgstr "对 *俯仰*、*油门* 和 *偏航* 重复上述操作，然后按 **Save** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:67 16ef26e922e14431b4ee74a71eb74518
#: 9475c05faa274d29b68131a22525ad54 a93605b4c0884df3807a8852e3bf2b54
#: ba3c5239926b49d9a957d35fc6139610 f136637ea4fd467cbc1b11a5c64e8286
msgid "You will likely want to set-up other buttons for *Arm* and *Disarm*"
msgstr "您可能需要为 *解锁* 和 *上锁* 配置其他按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:68 cb934e0c5ca24a2ebb1588c5bdae5529
msgid ""
"Instead of setting up a stick or button for ch5 (the flight mode channel), "
"it is better to set individual buttons to initiate a flight mode by "
"selecting **Change Mode** and then push the **Settings** button and select "
"the flight mode from the drop-down (see pic above)"
msgstr ""
"与其为 ch5（飞行模式通道）设置摇杆或按钮，不如通过选择 **Change Mode** 并按 **Settings** "
"按钮从下拉菜单中选择飞行模式，为各飞行模式分配独立按钮（参见上图）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:72 616fcfd3cc6e48f4a20346d0c5abb591
#: 9f81478dc7af49dbb9936af608a5ca70 c101ebb9951447c6b02096946eff09e6
#: de84996f60554000b054d4932b64eedb fd61dcb809d7439d989bb93095e1514c
msgid ""
"When done, push the **Save** button. This records the min and max "
"calibrations and records the neutral positions of the joystick for the trim "
"value. Mission Planner will then scale the joystick signal to the RC "
"channel's ``RCx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` parameters in the autopilot when sending RC "
"override commands by the Joystick."
msgstr ""
"完成后，按 **Save** 按钮。这将记录最小/最大校准值并记录操纵杆的中立位置作为微调值。Mission Planner 随后会在通过操纵杆发送 "
"RC 覆盖指令时，将操纵杆信号按比例缩放到飞控中 RC 通道的 ``RCx_MIN/MAX/TRIM`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:73 c997d61c05fe4984a839f99d6ae2d798
msgid ""
"In the **CONFIG/TUNING \\| Full Parameter List**, check that the "
":ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID <MAV_GCS_SYSID>` parameter matches the system ID of your"
" GCS. This parameter limits which GCS can send override signals to the "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"在 **CONFIG/TUNING \\| Full Parameter List** 中，检查 :ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID "
"<MAV_GCS_SYSID>` 参数是否与您地面站的系统 ID 匹配。该参数限制哪个地面站可向飞行器发送覆盖信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:82 dda03f74b3814e18b40821ae73a29214
msgid "For Mission Planner the default GCS system ID is 255. The"
msgstr "Mission Planner 的默认地面站系统 ID 为 255。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:81 6b78538aa9c04bc9b3c4ece42c054b87
msgid ""
"default system ID for APM Mission Planner 2 is 252 (but the GCS will "
"automatically set its ID to match *SYSID_MYGCS* for RC Override commands)."
msgstr ""
"APM Mission Planner 2 的默认系统 ID 为 252（但地面站会自动将其 ID 设置为与 *SYSID_MYGCS* 匹配，用于 "
"RC 覆盖指令）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:87 1a8a222c84964961b6b446a61a67a723
msgid ""
"If you get an error **PreArm: RC not calibrated** (following calibration) "
"you will additionally need to manually change ``RC1_MIN`` to 1101 and "
"``RC1_MAX`` to 1901 (and then repeat for RC2\\_, RC3\\_ and RC4\\_ max/min "
"parameters)."
msgstr ""
"如果（校准后）出现错误 **PreArm: RC not calibrated**，则还需手动将 ``RC1_MIN`` 改为 "
"1101，``RC1_MAX`` 改为 1901（然后对 RC2\\_、RC3\\_ 和 RC4\\_ 的最大/最小参数重复相同操作）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:93 2fcb762953cf45a7bb83c16de84c1a76
#: 359ec0c55f0c4ce5bc3aa3747b4173a2 36517158736f4009859beb189527388d
#: 877984df24504e0c99ca2b557759f44f c4854b0c99f74c419630e63ba41281f2
msgid ""
"This error is caused because *Mission Planner* maps the Joystick exactly to "
"the RC min and max range, but the pre-arm checks assume that if the values "
"are not at least 1 PWM us off the default value, that calibration has not "
"been done. If you have RC calibrated your transmitter/receiver system "
"already, this will not be necessary. **DO NOT RC CALIBRATE THE JOYSTICK**, "
"it is not the same control mechanism as is used for RC systems. It uses "
"MAVLink override messages."
msgstr ""
"此错误是因为 *Mission Planner* 将操纵杆精确映射到 RC 最小/最大范围，而解锁前检查假定若值距默认值不足 1 个 PWM "
"微秒，则未完成校准。若您已对遥控器/接收机系统完成 RC 校准，则无需此操作。**请勿对操纵杆进行 RC 校准**，操纵杆与 RC "
"系统使用的控制机制不同，它使用 MAVLink 覆盖消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:99 2a86666e29f547a79768ce80c9cdc119
#: 6b660e8f45d64afc96f2d5882d80bb9e 6bd8e090181d4ec389375d50f5f6b1b7
#: 8ddad7226e744d79adea48f0eccba3f6 df960686f09e48739f59e14d381bfb16
msgid "Testing the controls before flying"
msgstr "飞行前测试控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:101 1b4c89b0bf0c4b3baa53853d6346837e
#: 5a34db42ca79437d8d5d99b30ac8a9fe 638172570f804bd4b84aa1476b93bad6
#: 863c2d4e5c6e4ddcbcb81e4d4bf2e4b1 b5968adf6c4a40d4a51b492ddc4b79ad
msgid ""
"Before flying for the first time you should test that all features work "
"well."
msgstr "首次飞行前，您应测试所有功能是否正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:104 7ac62e220d1147179d894b406c15e518
#: 91023ab6097a4e9796b304b66a152fee e52d0c1f18f24bc699bb22961867f1e1
#: ef23652d8aec4d76ad13d9869d56a063 ff2c181809c14d9ca5482209adc28dc5
msgid "To check the above controls move in the correct direction:"
msgstr "检查上述控制器是否向正确方向移动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:106 5a6a35d891024286a1eea4db7970bfd8
#: 7b8758b4c3c34c4689a6db834bcf17e4 808cfdce9c7742a5a5f35b8d1dbec5cc
#: 964de421a73941ac83bd375661faa11f e750449736af49d5a8d8c2af34dfc491
msgid ""
"Click the **Enable** button on the Joystick setup screen to enable sending "
"messages to the vehicle"
msgstr "点击操纵杆设置界面的 **Enable** 按钮，启用向飞行器发送消息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:108 44b55a96c69d44fe94d01dbccfc0cd3e
#: 8ed8bdf838c14b31bec1a4d93b4ee14d 94a2a60afe7a4537a5ec563192834136
#: b5a89abe72864107a749a86719a6f2b8 ed98f28739bd49af9467348ef9347b44
msgid "Connect your autopilot to the computer with a USB cable"
msgstr "用 USB 线将飞控连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:109 186de40f09214760bb98c0b78d5b620b
#: 2617c3a0bb5a42d9ada6ccb2bdfc4ccd 52a20501c7804fad98295032b1725481
#: d8f33a68db0c4a95812e231382433a65 e2fb69a3da0649089c05598514af5656
msgid "Push the Mission Planner's **Connect** button"
msgstr "按下 Mission Planner 的 **Connect** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:110 04c13ab8568741f28a52234244a61649
#: 2450bec94f874df8a563ba47def58611 67613a3e125e4081bc6d4d973818a231
#: 982d83ad2bc04d1494a188c0d44c7b2b dc865f3b5d2949e2b5c009696572e221
msgid ""
"Go to the **Initial Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio Calibration** "
"screen and ensure the green bars all move in the correct direction.  "
"Remember the bars move in the same direction as the sticks except for Pitch "
"which moves in the opposite direction."
msgstr ""
"进入 **Initial Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware \\| Radio Calibration** "
"界面，确认所有绿色条均向正确方向移动。请注意，各条的移动方向与摇杆相同，但俯仰方向相反。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:114 38a96de288754ed398cbe8bb28904060
#: 57045b4f3fb74bf2860a159f8cdc5481 a74e55c44bd545ea80429ccbda6252dc
#: d5be47fbe99f4c3a87497a12779d9260 da1674043fea4b0c8b7a281bb5901733
msgid ""
"If any controls are reversed, check the **Reverse** checkbox on the Joystick"
" setup screen."
msgstr "若有控制方向反转，请勾选操纵杆设置界面中的 **Reverse** 复选框。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:117 6ebb3c178513479086157a74290aace6
msgid ""
"Next test you are able to arm, disarm and switch into the various flight "
"modes (not need to connect the battery)"
msgstr "接下来测试能否解锁、上锁以及切换各飞行模式（无需连接电池）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:121 10dcb5c09c8742c083cc5b4c5f0092ab
#: 1b178c16512546f8b09acb174ac5811e 3c4af96c063e4d17bc9eaaa2449e0385
#: 8eee0ca4ce7e488896f4de57b9050e1f d70d497a61054bb9affff94df177a00b
msgid "Testing the failsafes"
msgstr "测试失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:123 355716cbb53d4afcb436a80093b265b4
#: c4d4855c89d54dd9ac723095e532dbf6 e746b734f363446fbf33e4d1f51a27d3
#: e909ce8b76c245b889c83ce95e684801 ff910bed29cb49bba3c8b5d64f635be4
msgid ""
"All of these tests should be performed on the ground with the battery "
"disconnected or at least with the propellers off the vehicle."
msgstr "所有这些测试都应在地面、断开电池或至少卸下螺旋桨的状态下进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:126 0b19098d593f4f99abca6f11895ce67f
#: 16392e4f27c54e05a414135efd085afc 74a45210875b4c58ab19df5779497ba6
#: ba15a2fd7a0747ba88a7d737a02bdedb fb798e62de9f4548b75cba3f9f369e5e
msgid ""
"**Simulate disabling the joystick in flight with transmitter off** (i.e. no "
"failover to regular transmitter):"
msgstr "**模拟飞行中禁用操纵杆且遥控器关闭** （即不切换到常规遥控器）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:129 3d673a805cda41b1a26299c779e723b8
#: 5a628e5a34f34c4b9ee310b14407ecb0 c404c96648c344158fea4370f84f8268
#: c92aa525312541dd8c57a9def18a6a4a e70f6ab587954b2a9bf3b9bcf98a70ee
msgid "Turn regular transmitter off"
msgstr "关闭常规遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:130 46ee5e07f0dc493d91bd4928154f5ab6
#: 8d2a7045179a42b187167282db6600c0 9034f431acdb4de5a3ae6d95cbb42a97
#: 9c912c6faa97480cbc44e3da37f9d2cd b41e0412ffe744fe8a48d9198707aaed
msgid ""
"Connect with the mission planner, push Joystick window's **Enable** button "
"and ensure RC overrides are being sent to the vehicle. (use Radio "
"Calibration screen or Flight Data's status screen)"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 连接，按下操纵杆窗口的 **Enable** 按钮，确认 RC 覆盖指令正在发送到飞行器（可通过 Radio "
"Calibration 界面或 Flight Data 的 status 界面查看）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:133 1eecd12fb2884d089f4a7b6dd3dc512b
#: 83a95c145b89409fa7aedf004e1c059a c7d4a6928f25488c9e9ffc8dabfb8670
#: e6ff1f0d991e4519b70bdcc0fd4b8698 eb052272d9bb4d6883201f1acd63457e
msgid "Arm vehicle, switch to Stabilize or Loiter mode and raise the throttle"
msgstr "解锁飞行器，切换到 Stabilize 或 Loiter 模式并推高油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:134 0dece5088d6e4b959e95e1158ea51abf
#: 90584f79b42f4b029f5a9f4253704a9b b0faec844a8f441aa6d873755aaaedce
#: bd9ffd7bbcc7438f96329061bf7a4ef2 e47f9fc09c4b4f14ac25ce9ee79957df
msgid ""
"Ensure the motors are spinning by checking the Flight Data screen's "
"\"ch1out\" ~ \"ch4out\""
msgstr "通过查看 Flight Data 界面的「ch1out」~「ch4out」确认电机正在旋转"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:136 318645f0ba154208a7cf789f7197e0f9
#: 33888b27f88a4a10af45f59fdfbee35c 86800b4a9a654fbd939817e6053aaa1f
#: 8d426fa836014b718224022932caca87 ad9f1ef6e7e64ccf867ac48612297003
msgid "Push Joystick screen's **Disable** button"
msgstr "按下操纵杆界面的 **Disable** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:137 1ba982fcc35243c9bf6e6716e1bacaea
#: 990c3f1956c5413dbcbc78fe1250bc63 bef12b53981e446f9a611a2a9c80f301
#: c889874de00a4e37becb50e9d22d9ecf dac557e706014925a0254a4516539773
msgid ""
"\"Failsafe\" should appear on the HUD and the vehicle should switch to "
"\"LAND\" or \"RTL\""
msgstr "HUD 上应出现「Failsafe」，飞行器应切换到「LAND」或「RTL」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:139 2d55ab8ea0dc4668bcdfa5ecf8a5c60a
#: 49dcb5ae701941b5b8062fdaf2d5cbf9 a4e721873287403c9e94e1c39e8ff826
#: c90cf56861384b80ab096a75a17dd69b d2342fee3cb649aaaa22c7fbedf58fff
msgid ""
"Repeat the above test but at step #5 actually disconnect the joystick from "
"the computer.  The results should be the same."
msgstr "重复上述测试，但在步骤 #5 时实际断开操纵杆与电脑的连接。结果应相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:145 3aed8f206ae2465eacd4edc0814dcd52
#: 41a89335096d4c1f9a25b66545883674 cf8450cb65e643a2a3ede093766b8abf
#: db45a1334e384adb892a274d87386c9b fb0c0c18bb764c148cc673ac137af95b
msgid "**Simulate failing over to the regular transmitter/receiver**"
msgstr "**模拟切换到常规遥控器/接收机**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:147 0e19bdfdae9145979abdc081638d2bf0
#: 8d49353633ef4f479429ee7f13411170 cf31abc556d342fc95d8ecab36d10d63
#: dd3fb892fc84440d85041e2268d8ef66 f864c33e1657406382aa23c104888875
msgid ""
"Turn the regular transmitter on and ensure you can control the vehicle "
"(perhaps by checking the Radio calibration page or the Flight Data screen's "
"Status tab's \"ch1in\" ~ \"ch8in\")."
msgstr ""
"打开常规遥控器，确认可以控制飞行器（可通过 Radio calibration 页面或 Flight Data 界面 Status "
"选项卡的「ch1in」~「ch8in」值确认）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:150 009ce67ad3e54c80a8f481c350f6fc9c
#: 065cd5abff1949569fecea7741789fc9 3158fec83c99440ebbf42861c269d783
#: 827e09ac3838490f89005f2a6938641e b6042fcae7c34d43ab6f9f40f21223d5
msgid ""
"With the regular transmitter leave the vehicle in AltHold mode and raise the"
" throttle to mid"
msgstr "用常规遥控器将飞行器保持在 AltHold 模式，并将油门推到中间"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:152 189eab2276d4499fb72f8e77a28ee982
#: 32353e0b7324444e80361a943dc1ce51 784aa6bdd36142c39473d693d732b33e
#: d23769a00b94427bb3a221b27bc38ca9 dbdefb5e5f5f4c9eb4fe7518157f9f05
msgid "On the Joystick screen push the **Enable** button"
msgstr "在操纵杆界面按 **Enable** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:153 1ee09b6406414dd69f8fd28da51ab74f
#: 598e7668af5b442fa8094dc97a371589 6222a363fb254403988d285906986fc9
#: 80139178151e4acabb19b9ac8e889df0 d692401f241d453c82e98b56923bcf6e
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle in STABILIZE mode and raise throttle to full (with the "
"Joystick)."
msgstr "在 STABILIZE 模式下解锁飞行器，并将油门（通过操纵杆）推到最大。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:155 18cdf7f5730941249d1faea04815acea
#: 3c105070797e4f40852ceb62ea58e73a a85428b5de6943f1bdc37cf79be1a53c
#: cd35b328833e4976abf3da25e4feb2cf d50be6cc9d70405cab8d83f49063c7c5
msgid ""
"Check the throttle is at full in the Flight Data screen's Status tab by "
"checking \"ch3in\" is very high (around 1900 usually)"
msgstr "在 Flight Data 界面 Status 选项卡中检查油门是否已到最大，即「ch3in」值很高（通常约为 1900）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:157 ab2bb419d1704c90b38d242047e5252f
#: ceff63880b824ff49752491cd5ecb0d8 ef6bbac1faac4b2497e8a5d10c613353
#: f10aa329c4474ecbad372b29c21f4005 f324cbfc637c40cf817352d1f9e7d994
msgid ""
"On the Joystick screen push the **Disable** button and check the \"ch3in\" "
"has dropped to a mid value (around 1500)"
msgstr "在操纵杆界面按 **Disable** 按钮，检查「ch3in」是否下降到中间值（约 1500）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:159 001d6dd24e374188b5216a1362623ada
#: 4f079f86992c49498f1057ec5b2b1327 79d01c0382a248a4a9de98ead08fe17c
#: cad3484820a04a4f813748ccd42e697f e8ab3002a4024acca3ce86d15826f0c8
msgid ""
"The vehicle should remain in its current flight mode (Stabilize) but "
"controls have been returned to the transmitter.  The pilot's inputs should "
"be reflected in the \"ch1in\" ~ \"ch8in\" values.  Switch the vehicle to "
"AltHold mode by moving the flight mode switch."
msgstr ""
"飞行器应保持当前飞行模式（Stabilize），但控制权已交还给遥控器。飞手的输入应反映在「ch1in」~「ch8in」值中。通过飞行模式拨杆将飞行器切换到"
" AltHold 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:164 035e50cbf154411b8dc3daae99163984
#: 0962530749be4fa58df5fe401137ff30 49c1b45a1785488ea36e236824404756
#: 90e32b292d2944499d8229fd63617cad e6859205fb0646a9b0e57bd30b6c88b9
msgid "**Simulate loss of radio contact**:"
msgstr "**模拟无线电连接丢失**："

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:166 2814b436a5d44d679307c8538c3b69b2
msgid ""
"If radio contact is lost, the vehicle should respond as if the Joystick was "
"\"Disabled\" or disconnected from the PC.  You can test this by repeating "
"the test above but instead of pushing the **Disable** button on the Joystick"
" screen, disconnect the radio.  In order to see the status of the vehicle "
"you will need to connect two Mission Planner's separately (only possible on "
"Pixhawk).  The Mission Planner with the Joystick should be connected through"
" telemetry and the 2nd Mission Planner should be connected through a USB "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"若无线电连接丢失，飞行器的响应应如同操纵杆被「禁用」或从 PC 断开连接一样。您可以通过重复上述测试来验证，但不是按操纵杆界面的 **Disable**"
" 按钮，而是断开无线电。为了查看飞行器状态，您需要分别连接两个 Mission Planner（仅 Pixhawk 支持）。带操纵杆的 Mission "
"Planner 应通过数传连接，第 2 个 Mission Planner 应通过 USB 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:176 633626d329b14d12bd7919d20cdf708f
#: 9d456510ca1f4260ba87f02956b436c9 b94ad887256b4514b0ea852f10dbf986
#: cef0726c5df64190a811829ceca550a7 e3efa253768246d2b056f95edbc8aa9e
msgid "Reducing lag in the controls"
msgstr "减少控制延迟"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:178 22b14e822b434d4783149d3ebfbde671
#: 304620e0710344fc99c374c1141f4adf 4a72d66096b9491287e7f5be44caf4c7
#: 78ddd28bd68d4a7aadd91e843abe1571 905d834644f144088298a5579dd5c1b8
msgid ""
"It is nearly impossible to make the Joystick as responsive as a regular "
"transmitter but lag can be reduced by:"
msgstr "操纵杆几乎不可能达到常规遥控器的响应速度，但可通过以下方式减少延迟："

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:181 43e86c7f323a416cab6b551982a44717
#: 852b92c29bb54752ae9a0a2dbe640183 cff3b469c83f466f8a699dfc2be032b4
#: d1703fbade9946daa3060d606ac90c0f e7d895554cb4456096812d61aae86a10
msgid ""
"Reducing the rate of other telemetry data being sent between the vehicle and"
" GCS from the MP's **Config/Tuning \\| Planner** page"
msgstr "在 MP 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Planner** 页面降低飞行器与地面站之间其他数传数据的发送速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:187 083aae142fb146e192b49d4a26d1fc1f
#: 36d7a5c76bcc49e0820ac3aab8557d0f 491095c4d1964130a14b73e3c7cfc0ff
#: 9a2e853b85ee470e95e637895d8150da fe601c484c3e44458fd8ff881861c4f2
msgid ""
"If using a SiK Radio or RFD900 Radio these can be put into :ref:`Low Latency"
" mode as described here <common-3dr-radio-advanced-configuration-and-"
"technical-information_low_latency_mode>`."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 SiK Radio 或 RFD900 Radio，可将其设置为 :ref:`此处描述的低延迟模式 <common-3dr-radio-"
"advanced-configuration-and-technical-information_low_latency_mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:7 1ea9e32c196c40a3bf63cb5c3c1c8328
#: 3dd70de4bff6444c9180972990da8013 43673e6c153146d98f33c5108277ea0b
#: dcb2142e016a4ba1ab4b43b6202ff103
msgid ""
"This article explains how you can control your vehicle with a Joystick or "
"Gamepad using the Mission Planner which sends \"RC Channel Override\" "
"messages to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"本文说明如何通过 Mission Planner 使用操纵杆或游戏手柄控制载具，Mission Planner 会向载具发送 “RC Channel "
"Override”（RC 通道覆盖）消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:9 0a9e591c64cb4ef7aa032c116a504568
#: 6207ae0bb7094aed9bb6f76090b29284 6a19a089f1e44ee8a9d1481f3b047540
#: beab03c24cbd4d4c93bd8b695b8b76d6
msgid ""
"Other GCSs including QGC also support \"RC Channel Overrides\" but they are "
"not covered in this article."
msgstr "其他地面站（包括 QGC）也支持 “RC Channel Overrides”，但本文不作介绍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:18 07233300ccb94884abdc897c4de7cc29
#: 8e7781ccfa304daf882cf940e60814b6 9040b4439f7a4215b51badc789b6980e
#: a581875afaa94f72868da0effcc319bc
msgid ""
"Even if flying with a joystick, you should keep a regular "
"transmitter/receiver connected and ready for use as a backup"
msgstr "即使使用操纵杆飞行，也应保持一套常规遥控器/接收机连接并随时可用，以作备份"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:42 6fa9a04e577b48ecbed1c6c11fa39b2c
#: 9d2b2529b31b42158db8879f95c65a5d c5d34bc9aeaf42d3b31e79fd2cb4b3b3
#: f5275bdbf8d24cce90877423d19161ba
msgid "Connect your USB joystick/gamepad to the PC"
msgstr "将 USB 操纵杆/游戏手柄连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:49 0caaab26e4fa4e7bbc48ba9826008d74
#: 0f4034b09be54618ab8e4670efe1b9b5 7d9d3414d68c48a49cbf5611de6cd092
#: d0b079768bf74ccdbbfea1d93da8b0ea
msgid "Ensure the joystick appears in the drop-down"
msgstr "确认操纵杆出现在下拉列表中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:66 2563df472700437db1de60c8cfa7d80e
#: 85cf5f6998ef4da289ad92b99bbbe29a 9aa831ba68f94d6f8aebb2c2c5b080ab
#: c6e3d25506b1405ea6dcc98710eaeff0
msgid ""
"The flight mode channel (e.g. RC5 or RC8) and :ref:`auxiliary function "
"channels <common-auxiliary-functions>` should not be controlled from the "
"joystick especially if a regular RC receiver is also connected.  Instead it "
"is better to configure buttons to set the flight mode by selecting **Change "
"Mode** and then push the **Settings** button and select the flight mode from"
" the drop-down (see pic above).  Details on why this is important are "
"documented in `issue #32862 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/32862>`__."
msgstr ""
"飞行模式通道（例如 RC5 或 RC8）以及 :ref:`辅助功能通道 <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"不应由操纵杆控制，尤其是在同时连接了常规 RC 接收机的情况下。更好的做法是通过配置按钮来设置飞行模式：选择 **Change Mode**，然后按 "
"**Settings** 按钮并从下拉列表中选择飞行模式（见上图）。这一点为何重要见 `issue #32862 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/32862>`__ 中的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:72 3d322b1bdd2c46839a72ce84bb4dff13
#: 6274f10b77f044b58a1b1b16e143fa0d 7c144b1c832a4c5e855f4269e51fcac2
#: 864dd06aad51452e9b3611b7d4909453
msgid "Autopilot Setup"
msgstr "飞控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:74 25ee3c34d40247e28f41770e574bf146
#: 39702470b5ce4eb2bbdb2f0e4c6c0c81 5279d5b3c27f41a7907be9be50582ffb
#: f40f22f7f3d54a80a5ee336fa335f773
msgid ""
"These parameters configure how the RC inputs are consumed by the autopilot:"
msgstr "这些参数配置飞控如何使用 RC 输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:76 32885fd20a7244739c0856d886944537
#: 556c58b287fe43eb8ef0e71597fbafa4 63cdad92da8247a488391d71a11a07a6
#: ae8730071d56459ab6f53bd6768594d8
msgid ""
":ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID <MAV_GCS_SYSID>` should match the GCS's mavlink system "
"ID.  By default Mission Planner and QGC use 255, APM Planner 2 is 252.  This"
" parameter limits which GCS can send override signals to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAV_GCS_SYSID <MAV_GCS_SYSID>` 应与地面站的 MAVLink 系统 ID 一致。默认情况下 Mission "
"Planner 和 QGC 使用 255，APM Planner 2 为 252。该参数限制哪个地面站可以向载具发送覆盖信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:82 0536de315c9240f990eae7b7154fda83
#: 22adee47e12a46b2a5938b4242c5646f 7805df25ba8144f0b408f4dde09ed2f9
#: d743892281024b808f3aaaebccc72873
msgid ""
":ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME <RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>`: Timeout in seconds after which "
"RC overrides will no longer be used, and regular RC input will resume. "
"Default is 3 seconds. 0 will disable RC overrides, -1 will never timeout, "
"and continue using overrides until they are disabled.  If no regular RC is "
"present on the vehicle this essentially defines the :ref:`RC failsafe "
"timeout <copter:radio-failsafe>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME <RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>`：超时时间（秒），超过该时间后 RC 覆盖不再生效，恢复常规 RC "
"输入。默认 3 秒。0 表示禁用 RC 覆盖，-1 表示永不超时，持续使用覆盖直至其被禁用。如果载具上没有常规 RC，这实际上就定义了 :ref:`RC"
" 失控保护超时 <copter:radio-failsafe>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:83 40e2cce875204f9fb096ea9a45b4ce0d
#: 5c9674eeeab74f95951bcfab9f022bd6 672880b8578f4af19d53e86334bcc7ec
#: a5f1db3a29434ee8b3df0997c840dca2
msgid ""
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS <RC_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (value 2) allow ignoring RC overrides "
"completely"
msgstr ":ref:`RC_OPTIONS <RC_OPTIONS>` 的 bit 1（值为 2）允许完全忽略 RC 覆盖"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:84 01b76c1937d84a169504085d18d35ff8
#: 3b3d701154e245e2853b7d43d593ba6b 45bca7b7472d43c3a9b516069374e406
#: 904dbe1f4e74461a993e175159b9b6eb
msgid ""
":ref:`RC Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>` 46 (RC Override "
"Enable) allows an RC input to enable/disable RC overrides.  This may be "
"useful to allow the pilot to easily switch between using a regular RC "
"transmitter and joystick"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC 辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 46（RC Override Enable）允许通过一个 RC "
"输入来启用/禁用 RC 覆盖。这便于飞手在常规遥控器和操纵杆之间轻松切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:88 0d910301dc324ca6a8f8156877b5d3a0
#: 700737e9249f4df0a9806c6eba55cde8 8730194679534efd97054bbd2eec5466
#: a1a1f87a29ef4f358e4cef072db8068d
msgid ""
"If you get an error **PreArm: RC not calibrated** (following calibration) "
"you will additionally need to manually change  :ref:`RC1_MIN <RC1_MIN>` to "
"1101 and :ref:`RC1_MAX <RC1_MAX>` to 1901 (and then repeat for RC2\\_, "
"RC3\\_ and RC4\\_ max/min parameters)."
msgstr ""
"如果（校准后）出现 **PreArm: RC not calibrated** 错误，还需要手动把 :ref:`RC1_MIN <RC1_MIN>` "
"改为 1101、:ref:`RC1_MAX <RC1_MAX>` 改为 1901（然后对 RC2\\_、RC3\\_ 和 RC4\\_ 的 "
"max/min 参数重复此操作）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:117 53a69311717847f694c3b805f819a730
#: 5d2f28945d8949ae8ac5e98e0f1163f8 6b1ffcf81f794a1988bd60271df584bf
#: f6e8c37f4c3e4ef482fc2bce47c8572b
msgid ""
"Next test you are able to arm, disarm and switch into the various flight "
"modes (no need to connect the battery)"
msgstr "接下来测试能否解锁、上锁并切换到各个飞行模式（无需连接电池）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:166 696ba7bdfb314e97a0e83555835ef763
