msgid ""
"If radio contact is lost, the vehicle should respond as if the Joystick was "
"\"Disabled\" or disconnected from the PC.  You can test this by repeating "
"the test above but instead of pushing the **Disable** button on the Joystick"
" screen, disconnect the radio.  In order to see the status of the vehicle "
"you will need to connect two Mission Planner's separately.  The Mission "
"Planner with the Joystick should be connected through telemetry and the 2nd "
"Mission Planner should be connected through a USB connection."
msgstr ""
"如果电台失联，载具的响应应与操纵杆被 “Disabled”（禁用）或从 PC 断开时相同。可以重复上面的测试来验证：不按操纵杆界面上的 "
"**Disable** 按钮，而是断开电台。为了观察载具状态，需要分别连接两个 Mission Planner：带操纵杆的 Mission "
"Planner 通过数传连接，另一个 Mission Planner 通过 USB 连接。"
